{"script":"s_5_9_2_y","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]太好了……让我们来试试吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯……就在那边试试吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]（点燃了寒冰爆桶。爆炸的威力瞬间引发了局部雪崩。）[l][cm]","charaName":""}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]太好了！能用这种低成本的炸弹引发雪崩封路，我们很快就能开辟出一条新的通道供熔火元素南迁。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这样就能减少它们闯入火龙山径主道的次数了，多年的冲突终于得以化解。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]其实熔火元素和我们都是为了生存。我们保障道路畅通是为了让商品和物资能更好地流通，而熔火元素南迁则是为了避寒。从立场上来说，我们都没有错。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]如果生存是零和博弈，那我们都会死伤惨重。作为智慧生物，我们理应寻求让双方共同生存的方法，这才是正确的道路。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]现在有了这种方法，既能节约我们的资源，又能为它们提供一条生存之路。虽然我们之间仍会有争斗，但已经找到了一条避免伤亡的共存之道。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]当然，这离不开你们的帮助。非常感谢几位远道而来的契约者。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}],"des":"火龙山径的迁徙-秘学系教授裴裴霍互动完成"}